            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.map()</code> fonksiyonunun içine satır içi bir fonksiyon ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyTypes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lengths = enemyTypes.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>function</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
