            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>places</code> dizisini <code>.map()</code> fonksiyonunun doldurmasını sağlayacak doğru anahtar kelimeyi yaz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"106\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" places = players.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index+\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;. &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(places);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
